{"type":"plan","title":"Đèn Ông Sao Của Tí","logline":"Đêm Trung thu, chiếc đèn giấy tắt ngấm được ông nội chụp lại bằng tình yêu giàu, sáng rạng ngời dưới trăng tròn.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Night, moonlight spilling on porch. Tí stands alone at railing holding unlit red star lantern. Down the lane, kids-group passes with glowing lanterns, laughter implied. Porch lanterns sway gently.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Sao đèn mình tắt mãi, trăng ơi..."},{"index":2,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Night, faint porch light. Tí's cupped hands shield candle; a gust blows flame out. Red cellophane ripples. Star-lantern dark again. Tí's shoulders drop.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Gió quá, thôi không chơi nữa."},{"index":3,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Night, warm interior glow spills from doorway. Grandfather steps out onto porch, bamboo-shade under arm. He pauses beside Tí, silent, eyes on dark lantern.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Chụp tre của ông năm nào, che gió cho con."},{"index":4,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Night, hands in focus. Grandfather's weathered fingers lower bamboo-shade over star-lantern top. Candle catches, flame steadies, red panels glow warm. Subtle drop shadows layer.","mode":"motion","dialogue":null},{"index":5,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Night, golden moonlight. Tí runs down lane, star-lantern glowing bright, joining kids-group. Lanterns sway, shadows stretch. Street depth layers: fences, poles, moon.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đi các anh chị ơi, đợi Tí nha!"},{"index":6,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Night, moonlight pools on threshold. Grandfather leans on gate post, silhouette against moon. Gentle smile, eyes follow Tí. Bamboo-shade absent now. Gate frames him.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Sáng đẹp lắm, con ơi."},{"index":7,"shotType":"Slow zoom-in","description":"Night, full moon centered. Silhouettes of star, carp, rabbit lanterns drift across face. Clouds barely move. Zoom deepens into moon glow, then fade to black.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Trăng Trung thu chiếu rọi tình yêu giàu."}]}
